- The four focused JVM namespaces and the JVM quick tier are taken as given; the shiva (JVM slow + full Dart) and jupiter (full Node) evidence is not in this dossier and remains a landing precondition.
- Everything else in the diff matches the rulings: the three ids, the deleted helpers, the id-only selector, the `Switched to <id>` message, the help/docstring text, the tests, and the 8.5.6 amendment.

